//! tests (`cli_robot.rs`, `cli_fuzz_contract.rs`) through `#[path]`.
//!
//! The binary keeps its own copy (`src/main.rs` `ROBOT_SCHEMA`), so this is an
//! independent freeze: changing the schema means editing both in the same
//! commit, deliberately, and saying so in the commit message.

